    <div itemprop="text">
      <p>For DRM-protected books, you need to remove DRM first — typically using <strong>Calibre</strong> with the <strong>DeDRM plugin</strong> (which requires the Kindle serial number). Then convert from AZW/MOBI to EPUB using Calibre's built-in converter or upload to converter-epub.com. However, this workflow is increasingly difficult as Amazon removes legacy download methods. The best long-term strategy is to buy DRM-free from retailers like Kobo or Google Play Books.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
