  <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">
      <p>No. Kindle Unlimited (KU) books are always DRM-protected as a condition of the KDP Select program. Even if the author would prefer DRM-free, KU participation requires Amazon's DRM. EPUB download is not an option for KU titles.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
