  <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
    <div itemprop="text">
      <p>There is no indication Amazon plans to add EPUB reading to Kindle hardware or apps. The EPUB download option is for <strong>backup and cross-platform transfer</strong>, not for reading on Kindle devices. Amazon's e-ink Kindles use the KFX format natively, and the company continues to invest in its proprietary rendering pipeline. For reading EPUBs on an e-ink screen, consider a Kobo, PocketBook, or Boox device instead.</p>
    </div>
