      <p>If you need to read a downloaded EPUB on an older Kindle that doesn't support EPUB, use <strong>Calibre</strong> to convert EPUB to MOBI or AZW3, then sideload via USB. Alternatively, use <a href="https://converter-epub.com">converter-epub.com</a>'s EPUB-to-MOBI conversion or use Amazon's Send-to-Kindle email service, which accepts EPUB attachments and converts them automatically.</p>
